Police Department, University of Illinois Springfield, One University Plaza, MS PDB1, Springfield, IL 62703-5407 University of Illinois at Springfield . One University Plaza . MS HRB30 . Springfield, Illinois 62703 . 217-206-6652. www.uis.edu/humanresources"
